{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>近日IG出現一位皮膚超白嘅正妹，獨自駕船出海影片，當中極具衝擊力的「黃金畫面」在網上討論區引發哄動！大家都急求靚女IG是什麼！</p>\n<h2>港女希臘自駕出海大騷世界級身材</h2>\n<p>經常分享出海照片的IG素人美女Connie，近日上傳了一段在希臘海域獨自駕駛船隻的短片。她在影片中透露這次行程沒有太多預先計劃，僅在前一日於當地預訂船隻，便成功出海航行長達3小時並欣賞日落美景。畫面中最令人矚目是她換上一件黑色吊帶前交叉款式比堅尼，心口大開完美展現世界級豐滿身材！</p>\n<h2>女主角福利超多 親自回覆泳衣數量</h2>\n<p>震撼影片曝光後迅速在各大討論區廣泛流傳，早前更有人直接留言發問「Baby，你到底有幾多套泳衣」。她直言「因為旅行買咗好多，多到我都唔記得」。Connie過往不時分享穿著不同款式水著出海的動態，每次登場均換上全新設計，非常養眼。</p>\n<h2>理大設計系畢業曾短暫留學英國</h2>\n<p>Connie於2022年在香港理工大學設計系正式畢業，過去亦曾經有短暫在英國生活的經歷，其目前IG集中分享旅行生活點滴，成功累積2.2萬名粉絲追蹤。她近年對水上活動情有獨鍾，經常出海追蹤海豚蹤跡，同時不斷上傳各種風格的泳裝照片回饋大批支持者。</p>\n<h2>網絡討論區狂讚：呢條女99分</h2>\n<p>不少網民看過影片後連環大讚「師姐少正」，直指其具備港女罕見的白滑特質，並留言表示「明明港女白滑係賣點」。討論區內充斥著各種高度評價，有人激讚她「又後生又長腿又身材頂級」，直言「呢條女99分」，同時亦有不少新網民四處查問「呢個ig係咩」。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553152922814005_9322887046b05a30991246.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553152922814005_9322887046b05a30991246.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>經常分享出海照片的IG素人美女Connie，近日上傳了一段在希臘海域獨自駕駛船隻的短片。（圖片來源：IG@chanpeihang）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553153019196369_6860792886b05a30a89216.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553153019196369_6860792886b05a30a89216.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>她近年對水上活動情有獨鍾，經常出海追蹤海豚蹤跡，同時不斷上傳各種風格的泳裝照片回饋大批支持者。（圖片來源：IG@chanpeihang）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553153351829168_10546322096b05a30dd2a40.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-3\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553153351829168_10546322096b05a30dd2a40.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>累積2.2萬名粉絲追蹤。（圖片來源：IG@chanpeihang）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553153529240167_8378066066b05a30fbb36c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553153529240167_8378066066b05a30fbb36c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>有人發問「Baby，你到底有幾多套泳衣」。她直言「因為旅行買咗好多，多到我都唔記得」。（圖片來源：IG@chanpeihang）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553153849466152_2125046786b05a3130870e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553153849466152_2125046786b05a3130870e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>有人激讚她「又後生又長腿又身材頂級」，直言「呢條女99分」（圖片來源：IG@chanpeihang）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553154142369207_4575907876b05a315efda8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553154142369207_4575907876b05a315efda8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Connie於2022年在香港理工大學設計系正式畢業。（圖片來源：IG@chanpeihang）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553154337934010_20454778436b05a317b87c1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553154337934010_20454778436b05a317b87c1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@chanpeihang）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T15:03:53.224342+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1192,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T14:45:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T16:17:51.562649+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T14:57:24.323788+00:00","content_hash":"e4f0a115f5194353bea7a136eb4f305cb8c3f4d9d13c82b66d6614dc14dca5b1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}